{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"barracks","model_identifier":"barracks","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# barracks\n\nBarracks: a long building, stone ground storey and timber upper storey, weapon racks outside and a practice yard with straw targets and a wooden practice post.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a compact hall of dark-stained timber on a cobble footing under a grey shingle roof, with a watch tower and bell at its left end and a stone chimney at its right. Its signature is the facade lined with round player-colour shields above lit shuttered windows; in front, a fenced sand training yard with straw dummies, archery butts, weapon racks and more shields on the fence.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a long hall of dark-stained timber on a cobble footing under a grey shingle roof, with a watch tower and bell at its left end and a stone chimney at its right. Its signature is the facade lined with round player-colour shields above lit shuttered windows; in front, a fenced sand training yard with straw dummies, archery butts, weapon racks and more shields on the fence.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 10 columns (224 x 160 units, 6.30 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -80..80, y 0..150, z -80..75 units.\n- Texture: 1024 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 504, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- barracks: 160 x 176 x 64 centred at x -16, z 40\n- practice yard: fence ring 204 x 16 x 60 at z -46 (walk-through)\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-2, 0, -6)\n- `fx_smoke` at (69, 142, 36)\n- `slot_rally` at (0, 0, -40)\n- `fx_window_4` at (-63, 69, 23.2)\n- `fx_window_5` at (-56, 69, 23.2)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-34, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_2` at (32, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_3` at (46, 31, 6.6)\n- `fx_window_6` at (62.2, 49, 17)\n- `fx_window_7` at (62.2, 49, 55)\n- `fx_window_8` at (-27, 33, 68.8)\n- `fx_window_9` at (3, 33, 68.8)\n- `fx_window_10` at (33, 33, 68.8)"},"resolution":{"width":1024,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"cobble_plinth_back#6a665e","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-47,0,62],"to":[61,12,67],"autouv":0,"color":7,"origin":[1,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,272,108,284],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[896,272,901,284],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[108,272,216,284],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[901,272,906,284],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[190,358,298,363],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[298,358,406,363],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"cf971d3e-48db-d21d-b730-7c134d8225bd"},{"name":"cobble_plinth_left#6a665e","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-47.12,-0.12,5],"to":[-38,12.12,63],"autouv":0,"color":5,"origin":[22,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[764,272,773,284],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[216,272,274,284],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[773,272,782,284],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[274,272,332,284],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[128,84,137,142],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[137,84,146,142],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ceacb56b-64b1-7306-0804-0c350613279f"},{"name":"cobble_plinth_right#6a665e","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[52,-0.12,5],"to":[61.24,12.12,63],"autouv":0,"color":8,"origin":[-20,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[782,272,791,284],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[332,272,390,284],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[791,272,800,284],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[390,272,448,284],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[1